This fixture exercises the deprecated `throw` / `try` / `catch`
forms (Phase S4).  It is retained during the
throw-deprecation-plan deprecation window so the compiled paths
keep getting test coverage while users migrate to `panic` /
`catch-unwind` and `result<T,E>`.

Will be deleted alongside DEPR-D0 (front-end deletion).  See
docs/upcoming/throw-deprecation-plan.md.
